import Link from "next/link";import { redirect } from "next/navigation";import type { Metadata } from "next";import { AdminWorkspaceHeader } from "../../../components/AdminWorkspaceHeader";import { AdminActionButton } from "../../../components/AdminActionButton";import { adminVendorsWorkspace } from "../../../lib/admin-runtime";import { getAdminSession } from "../../../lib/admin-session";
export const metadata:Metadata={title:"Admin · Vendors",robots:{index:false,follow:false}};
export default async function Page(){const p=await getAdminSession();if(!p)redirect('/admin/login');const d=await adminVendorsWorkspace(p);return <main className="vendor-app admin-app"><AdminWorkspaceHeader csrfToken={d.csrfToken}/><section className="shell vendor-hero vendor-hero-compact"><div><div className="eyebrow">KYB / onboarding governance</div><h1>Vendor applications</h1><p className="lead">State transitions are constrained by the Core onboarding workflow; activation cannot skip verification, catalog onboarding and test-ready gates.</p><div className="hero-actions"><Link className="button button-secondary" href="/admin/research-vendors">Research acquisition queue</Link><Link className="text-link" href="/admin/categories">Category governance →</Link></div></div></section><section className="shell vendor-section">{d.applications.length===0?<article className="vendor-card-form"><div className="eyebrow">No formal applications</div><h3>No merchant has entered the governed application workflow yet.</h3><p>Research prospects remain separate until an owner claim or formal application is initiated.</p><Link className="text-link" href="/admin/research-vendors">Review research prospects →</Link></article>:<div className="vendor-order-list">{d.applications.map(a=><article className="vendor-order" key={a.id}><div className="vendor-order-head"><div><strong>{a.tradingName}</strong><small>{a.legalName} · {a.contactEmail} · {a.postcode}</small></div><span className="status-pill">{a.state}</span></div><div className="vendor-order-lines"><span>Category: {a.primaryCategory}</span><span>Tax no.: {a.taxNumber??'—'} · Plan: {a.requestedPlanCode}</span></div><div className="vendor-order-foot"><span>{a.verificationNotes??a.shopStory??'No verification notes.'}</span><div>{a.state==='verification_pending'&&<AdminActionButton label="Pass verification" endpoint={`/api/admin/vendors/${a.id}/transition`} csrfToken={d.csrfToken} body={{to:'catalog_onboarding'}} reasonPrompt="Verification reason"/>}{a.state==='catalog_onboarding'&&<AdminActionButton label="Mark test ready" endpoint={`/api/admin/vendors/${a.id}/transition`} csrfToken={d.csrfToken} body={{to:'test_ready'}} reasonPrompt="Test-ready evidence"/>}{a.state==='test_ready'&&<AdminActionButton label="Activate" endpoint={`/api/admin/vendors/${a.id}/transition`} csrfToken={d.csrfToken} body={{to:'active'}} reasonPrompt="Activation approval reason"/>}{!['closed','active'].includes(a.state)&&<AdminActionButton label="Restrict" endpoint={`/api/admin/vendors/${a.id}/transition`} csrfToken={d.csrfToken} body={{to:'restricted'}} reasonPrompt="Restriction reason" danger/>}</div></div></article>)}</div>}</section></main>}
